let falseSeed=17;function runFalsePositiveSimulation(){const apparent=[],significant=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){falseSeed=(1664525*falseSeed+1013904223)>>>0;const u=falseSeed/4294967296;apparent.push(u>.5);significant.push(u<.05)}const apparentCount=apparent.filter(Boolean).length,significantCount=significant.filter(Boolean).length;document.getElementById('false-positive-count').textContent=`${apparentCount}/100`;document.getElementById('significant-count').textContent=`${significantCount}/100`;['false-positive-bars','significant-bars'].forEach((id,index)=>{const values=index?significant:apparent,root=document.getElementById(id);root.replaceChildren(...values.map(v=>{const bar=document.createElement('i');bar.style.height=`${v?100:18}%`;bar.title=v?alphaText('positiveResult'):alphaText('nullResult');return bar}))})}
